  "section_type": "Class Roster",
  "class_designation": "[{\"height\":0.11637375921690507,\"text\":\"ORAMA FESTIVAL\",\"width\":0.6750523880306327,\"x\":0.13626835510118565,\"y\":0.7964169395192546},{\"height\":0.010174418272335228,\"text\":\"The Judges look on\",\"width\":0.15513626629747773,\"x\":0.3920335414843849,\"y\":0.5625000003357316},{\"height\":0.0030168166766337823,\"text\":\".。\",\"width\":0.029350101330991252,\"x\":0.5450733784749655,\"y\":0.5638436482590389},{\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"text\":\"The Drama Competition organised by the Student Council\",\"width\":0.5199161217331549,\"x\":0.23270441530393254,\"y\":0.5159609122144277},{\"height\":0.008846867589298202,\"text\":\"was\",\"width\":0.039832282941070024,\"x\":0.19077568309270745,\"y\":0.504234527625262},{\"height\":0.01468544068476274,\"x\":0.23480085286232247,\"y\":0.5013029312918087,\"width\":0.5178196818225247,\"text\":\"divided into three sections — Senior, Intermediate and\"},{\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.18867923569123393,\"y\":0.4869186051614447,\"width\":0.5660377423491887,\"text\":\"Junior. Three classes entered for the Senior section and four for\"},{\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.18867925328805804,\"y\":0.46802325554280844,\"width\":0.5639413024385583,\"text\":\"the Intermediate section. With the Lower Six students acting\"},{\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.18867924959833082,\"y\":0.45203488375017276,\"width\":0.5639413024385582,\"text\":\"as directors, all the eight classes of Forms I and II took part in\"},{\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.18867924959833082,\"y\":0.43604651168621933,\"width\":0.5639413024385582,\"text\":\"the Junior section. We are greatly indebted to Rev. Frs. Cor-\"},{\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.19077568756203173,\"y\":0.42005813959319604,\"width\":0.561844862527928,\"text\":\"bally, Barrett, O'Rourke and Grogan who kindly acted as the\"},{\"height\":0.016286644951140072,\"x\":0.18867925154102805,\"y\":0.40390879453459994,\"width\":0.5639413024385583,\"text\":\"adjudicators and Rev. Fr. Toner who was very generous with his\"},{\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.18867923690965185,\"y\":0.3895348840131888,\"width\":0.5639413024385584,\"text\":\"time in doing the make-up for the actors. The attendance on\"},{\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.19077568706688428,\"y\":0.3719869709878897,\"width\":0.5639413024385583,\"text\":\"the whole, especially in the Junior section, was quite good be-\"},{\"height\":0.013125899249645356,\"x\":0.18867925317108009,\"y\":0.35755814009967135,\"width\":0.5241090015544156,\"text\":\"cause the competition took place immediately after school.\"},{\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.23270441970221617,\"y\":0.3400651466622552,\"width\":0.5220125616437852,\"text\":\"All the actors are to be. congratulated on the way in which\"},{\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.18658279889878113,\"y\":0.3226744185394168,\"width\":0.5660377423491886,\"text\":\"they learn their lines. There was little need of prompting and\"},{\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.19077567963750364,\"y\":0.306686046724979,\"width\":0.5618448625279281,\"text\":\"what did need to be done was skilfully concealed from the\"},{\"height\":0.015117286160248433,\"x\":0.18862700426543488,\"y\":0.2902190225031158,\"width\":0.5661400609272108,\"text\":\"audience. All should remember that the greatest number of\"},{\"height\":0.015081959826938496,\"x\":0.19072392913113626,\"y\":0.2742362580209944,\"width\":0.5619543009172154,\"text\":\"points are awarded for diction so that the greatest care should\"},{\"height\":0.013170403222696025,\"x\":0.190775685657031,\"y\":0.2586319220846094,\"width\":0.5639413024385582,\"text\":\"be taken to be heard clearly and distinctly. It was on this point\"},{\"height\":0.013142942993959239,\"x\":0.18867924327570618,\"y\":0.24267100998413094,\"width\":0.3291404630817115,\"text\":\"that the competition was won or lost.\"},{\"height\":0.01453488377872425,\"x\":0.2327044175271639,\"y\":0.225290697718196,\"width\":0.5220125616437853,\"text\":\"The Senior and Intermediate sections took place in Novem-\"},{\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.190775685657031,\"y\":0.20930232561063777,\"width\":0.5639413024385582,\"text\":\"ber. Shortage of time and the difficulty of getting the use of the\"},{\"height\":0.014689228045435598,\"x\":0.18867923495748137,\"y\":0.19315960912008934,\"width\":0.5660377423491887,\"text\":\"stage for practice resulted in a little lack of final polish in most\"},{\"height\":0.014681652702803749,\"x\":0.1907756763251346,\"y\":0.1758720929362193,\"width\":0.5618448625279281,\"text\":\"of the productions. Thus, while none of the plays was badly\"},{\"height\":0.014658927296194335,\"x\":0.1907756894166395,\"y\":0.15830618910867178,\"width\":0.5639413024385583,\"text\":\"produced, no one play was outstandingly better than all the\"},{\"height\":0.011726384364820874,\"x\":0.19077568366652373,\"y\":0.14527687314499171,\"width\":0.060796642572612886,\"text\":\"others.\"},{\"height\":0.013107908043876959,\"x\":0.268343834112064,\"y\":0.14389534916580504,\"width\":0.4863731405809031,\"text\":\"The Junior section was held in April. On the whole，\"},{\"height\":0.015626926608504954,\"x\":0.18858680173925071,\"y\":0.12747181147692088,\"width\":0.564127967812941,\"text\":\"it was very successful and most of the actors did very well. May\"},{\"height\":0.014534883778724361,\"x\":0.19077568126224148,\"y\":0.11191860480395177,\"width\":0.561844862527928,\"text\":\"the Student Council extend its gratitude to all the Lower Six\"},{\"height\":0.014657980456026065,\"x\":0.18867925077981523,\"y\":0.09446254088489048,\"width\":0.5031446598659455,\"text\":\"students who gave a helping hand in directing the plays.\"},{\"height\":0.013081394655308443,\"x\":0.842767296108276,\"y\":0.06250000041943882,\"width\":0.023060795953558588,\"text\":\"13\"}]",
  "summary": "[{\"height\":0.11637375921690507,\"text\":\"ORAMA FESTIVAL\",\"width\":0.6750523880306327,\"x\":0.13626835510118565,\"y\":0.7964169395192546},{\"height\":0.010174418272335228,\"text\":\"The Judges look on\",\"width\":0.15513626629747773,\"x\":0.3920335414843849,\"y\":0.5625",
